4. SPONSORSHIP LICENSE — GRANT
==============================

4.1 Automatic grant. Upon the Licensor's receipt of a Sponsorship, the
Licensor grants the applicable sponsor a license to exercise all rights in
Section 2 free of the limits in Section 3. No separate agreement, quotation,
or countersignature is required. The grant takes effect on receipt of the
